  "judgment": "The commander-native self-untap loop is real, but the same two cards are a generic 2-card infinite-mana engine. The owner explicitly rejected Mindcrank + Bloodchief Ascension as generic combo conversion and rejected Aphetto Alchemist; this is an owner decision, not a first-pass swap."
