 "castability_method": "Exact (hypergeometric enumeration, no sampling) probability that Gwendlyn Di Corci can be cast for source-paid {U}{B}{B}{R}\n(four coloured pips, no generic) by turn 3/4/5 on the play and turn 4 on the draw. Sources grouped by colour set from live Oracle text. Assumptions (stated, not hidden):\neach of the deck's fetchlands can fetch a typed dual of any needed colour, so counts as any one colour; Exotic Orchard and Fellwar Stone count as any colour (opponent\ndependent: optimistic); tapped lands are assumed sequenced on an earlier turn; a 2-mana rock is castable by turn 2 with 2 lands (two with\nSol Ring), Sol Ring adds colourless only (useless for the commander's pips but can pay for a rock); Ancient Tomb is colourless; Urborg counted as B only (its type-granting is ignored: conservative); Chrome Mox, Lotus Petal, Lion's Eye Diamond, Dark Ritual and Patriar's Seal are ignored (conservative); Bojuka Bog/Xander's Lounge/Crumbling Necropolis tapped-entry assumed sequenced earlier. Only colour-coverage of the three pips is tested.",
